                        "text":  {
                                     "text":  "The food was quite delicious and reasonably priced, but it seemed the restaurant was understaffed, so serving food and ordering dishes was relatively slow.\n\nAlso, I suggest the restaurant add a hook in the restroom; it\u0027s quite inconvenient to take off your coat without a place to hang it.",
                                     "languageCode":  "en-US"
                                 },
                        "originalText":  {
                                             "text":  "蠻好吃的，價格也不貴，不過感覺店家人手不足，所以上菜和送菜菜單都相對比較慢，\n另外建議店家可以在廁所裡面放一個掛勾，脫個外套卻沒有地方掛，蠻麻煩的",
