                        "googleMapsUri":  "https://www.google.com/maps/reviews/data=!4m6!14m5!1m4!2m3!1sChdDSUhNMG9nS0VJQ0FnTUNBN2RMQ2xBRRAB!2m1!1s0x3442ab8e73aa612d:0x964d136fa14c7168"
                    },
                    {
                        "name":  "places/ChIJLWGqc46rQjQRaHFMoW8TTZY/reviews/ChdDSUhNMG9nS0VJQ0FnSURyMEtQRGpRRRAB",
                        "relativePublishTimeDescription":  "a year ago",
                        "rating":  4,
                        "text":  {
                                     "text":  "One of the oldest restaurants in the Minsheng community, this shop has moved from its original alleyway location to a main street location, but the craftsmanship remains unchanged, mainly serving home-style dishes.\n\nThe stir-fries are all common dishes; we ordered leafy greens, shredded pork with shredded vegetables, three-cup chicken leg, and sweet and sour pork ribs.\n\nThe stir-fried cabbage and water spinach were cooked to perfection, making them good choices for leafy greens. Personally, I found the shredded pork with shredded vegetables too salty, even with rice; the sweet and sour pork ribs were quite good, with a pleasant sweet and sour flavor; the clams weren\u0027t overcooked, with just the right amount of freshness; the three-cup chicken leg was essentially frog legs cooked in three cups, similar to chicken; the Hakka stir-fry was a bit of a disappointment, too salty, which didn\u0027t feel like Hakka cuisine. The tofu casserole and water bamboo shoots were average.\n\nOverall, the dining environment is very nice, but the ordering process is quite slow. There\u0027s a wide selection of dishes, allowing you to choose your favorite home-style dishes.",
                                     "languageCode":  "en-US"
                                 },
                        "originalText":  {
                                             "text":  "民生社區的老店之一，從原本巷子搬到大馬路上的店面，手藝依舊，主要以家常料理為主。\n炒菜類都是常見的菜色，我們點了青菜、金莎軟絲、三杯鳳腿、糖醋排骨等。\n炒高麗菜、空心菜的火候掌握很好，算是青菜類的好選擇。金莎軟絲個人覺得過鹹，即便配飯吃還是蠻鹹的；糖醋排骨還不賴，酸甜好滋味；海瓜子也不會過老，鮮度剛剛好；三杯鳳腿就是青蛙腿做出三杯料理，其實跟雞肉差不多；客家小炒個人覺得有點雷，口味太重鹹，這樣就不像是客家料理了。豆腐煲和茭白筍算是中規中矩。\n整體來說，用餐環境很不錯，不過點菜速度頗慢，菜色選擇多，可以挑選自己喜歡的家常料理。",
                                             "languageCode":  "zh-Hant"
                                         },
